+
+Reference mechanisms: Cherry Studio hides dialect settings for system providers; Pi binds native
+API implementations to providers; OpenCode supplies provider-specific SDK loaders; Cindy and
+OpenClaw retain explicit per-route capability metadata. CC Switch presets bind protocol, endpoint
+and model compatibility together. Reuse these boundaries, not their account stores or Agent loops.
